; DT818_pro_v5 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio (NO ROTATION, FRACTAL-CONFIRMED, HEDGES DISABLED)
; Generated 2026-05-24 from output/wfo_orb_v5_expire_extend/oos_rank.csv
; Use with ea/DT818_pro_v5.mq5 (compiled 2026-05-24 with global _ORB_FractalConfirm input).
;
; v5 vs v4 key changes:
;   1. Global _ORB_FractalConfirm=true + _ORB_FractalWidth=5 (V2 fractal-confirmed entry)
;   2. NO ROTATION (S1..S6 = ranks 1..6 from a single WFO, no prev-week mixing)
;   3. Per-stream PendingExpireMinutes varies (was 240 uniform; WFO showed 480-720 better)
;   4. ALL HEDGES DISABLED (hedge WFO failed decay-filter + recent tape broke premise)
;
; Source: output/wfo_orb_v5_expire_extend/oos_rank.csv (1125-config grid x 4 may23 windows)
; Comparison vs v4 may23 (May 2-23, 30pt, 1%/stream): +44% NP, halved DD, 3.32x NP/DD$_hc.
;
; Per-stream params (all Range=90, fractal_confirm=true, fractal_width=5):
;   S1: SL=550 RR=4.0 HTP=0.2 Exp=720  -- WFO rank#1 4/4 NP/DD$=3875
;   S2: SL=400 RR=3.5 HTP=0.4 Exp=240  -- WFO rank#2 4/4 NP/DD$=3498
;   S3: SL=550 RR=4.0 HTP=0.2 Exp=480  -- WFO rank#3 4/4 NP/DD$=4039 (best NP/DD$ of any 4/4)
;   S4: SL=550 RR=4.0 HTP=0.2 Exp=240  -- WFO rank#4 4/4 NP/DD$=3587
;   S5: SL=550 RR=2.0 HTP=0.4 Exp=720  -- WFO rank#5 4/4 NP/DD$=3632
;   S6: SL=400 RR=3.5 HTP=0.4 Exp=720  -- WFO rank#7 3/4 NP/DD$=3713 (substituted from rank#6 Exp=1440)
;
; PARENT total risk: 9.0% (1.5% x 6 streams). Range filter DISABLED.
; Hedge layer: DISABLED in this setfile. Hedge WFO 2026-05-24 P0 fail + W4 OOS -$2,458;
;   fractal-gate, alpha sweep, F1 sweep all unable to fix decay.
;   Hedge inputs kept (legacy values) but _HEDGE_S*_Enabled=false.
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; sim default 30pt)

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
_RiskPct=1.5||1.5||1||1.5||1.5||N
_LotMode=1||1||1||1||1||N
TierBase=2000||2000||1||2000||2000||N
LotStep=0.01||0.01||1||0.01||0.01||N
